// GHCN-D daily observations, the USW00003* station fraction: 195 small files per tree,
// 20,064,326 rows, on anonymous S3. Two variants hold PROVEN-identical rows (equal counts and
// content hashes): the uncompressed csv/by_station tree is headered; the gzip csv.gz/by_station
// tree is SYSTEMATICALLY headerless (all 195 files) - a real published-dataset dialect
// difference, expressed per-variant (header_row false + positional path mappings on the gz leg).
// The by_station trees have been frozen since 2025-02 (stable pins); by_year regenerates daily
// and is unpinnable (declared gap). Expected tables derived at authoring time by clickhouse
// local over the scratch copy of the same pinned objects.

// corpus: ghcnd-usw3
// reference-variant: ghcnd-usw3-s3-csv-uncompressed-small
// pinned: 195 objects, 700125209 bytes (csv tree), USW00003* stations, frozen since 2025-02
// oracle: clickhouse local 26.8.1.1309
// oracle-sql: SELECT count() FROM file('csv/*.csv', CSVWithNames, 'ID String, DATE Int64, ELEMENT String, DATA_VALUE Nullable(Int64), M_FLAG String, Q_FLAG String, S_FLAG String, OBS_TIME String')
// oracle-run: 2026-08-14
// read-shape: aggregate
// max-rows: 1
q01_countObservations
required_capability: dataset_in_from_command
dataset: ghcnd_usw3: "{{corpus}}"
FROM ghcnd_usw3 | STATS count = COUNT(*);

count:long
20064326
;

